{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115076278261022720"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T13:41:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115076504778691007"], "id": "2115076504778691007", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 376, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2103300004966478284", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈,  Muse 罕见来了小版本更新 \n\n在我的记忆中, 这是第一次碰到同是一个大版本的小版本更新 \n\n估计是出了大bug 了 https://t.co/5womlOERQb https://t.co/4dwpt0XDYn", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115076504778691007"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T13:24:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115072135744114989"], "id": "2115072135744114989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 248, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115065593107800136", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "X 原创内容达标之后,  没有港卡怎么收钱,  可以看看 leaf 这篇 \n\nWise 入金激活完全指南,  这可是他躺了几天坑, 才踩出来的经验,  太宝贵了 https://t.co/p9FgefqQ9H", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115072135744114989"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T12:25:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115057238637457503"], "id": "2115057238637457503", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 446, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114973973503185354", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Cara 从好莱坞到腾讯，再到内容OPC， Cara 这一路都是很有魄力。 \n\n最核心还是对内容的高品质追求，支持着她往前行 https://t.co/YK3dM14zU3", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115057238637457503"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T10:40:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115030923913928919"], "id": "2115030923913928919", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1759530111534243840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2936, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114996566755037275", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "多方证实，这个海外博主搞得这个是纯演示的图，根本不是现实