b 仓库直接收藏：\n\nawesome-opus5-5-videos（11k★） 目前最全的爆款合集，每条都带原帖和可复制提示词 https://t.co/O4x35aiqL3\n\nawesome-opus-5.5-video 中文友好，2000+ 作品收录，大量带提示词 https://t.co/dEWC6zQwj6\n\nlemo-opuscar 59", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114960802478535139"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T05:16:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114949287562121452"], "id": "2114949287562121452", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1715, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114677567013998793", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "海外卡可以看看 Giffgaff ,  这篇文章写了使用、退款全部攻略 , 值得一看 https://t.co/JcvzZzXow4", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114949287562121452"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114933517436272640"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:15:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114934070002225345"], "id": "2114934070002225345", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 5442, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114931219557453932", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "牛逼 ❗️❗️❗️ Claude Duet 的保姆级教程,  总算是有人写了 .   \n\n重点 Duet 的资格太难拿了,  等了这么久才有人写 \n\n就看 Duet 有没有机会打败 Grok Bot 了\n\nChatGpt 的 Dots 感觉已经退出战斗了 https://t.co/bPuzXoBmfT https://t.co/0OCJrJ7JL6", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114934070002225345"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T03:29:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114922381655650343"], "id": "2114922381655650343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4460, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude Duet 有谁拿到及格了 \n\n坐等 Claude Duet 保姆级教程都已经好几天了\n\n怎么迟迟还没有人写啊啊啊啊啊", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114922381655650343"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-27T02:37:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114909280730296588"], "id": "2114909280730296588", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1313, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_cou