"url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114873535651021276"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114728067042074624"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:12:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114737032388026855"], "id": "2114737032388026855", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1359, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114728345464152065", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "卧槽 ❗️❗️❗️  大洲@johnzhou123 这套视频效果,  出去卖钱至少 399 不成问题啊 .  \n\n基本把我 X 上有的帖子,  都给翻了一遍吧 \n\n账号的秘密全被挖出来了 ,  只能说牛逼的飞起\n\n这效果是非常的好啊,   板上钉钉基本上就是 Opus 5.5 做的 \n\nhttps://t.co/N9qVHs2piM https://t.co/4f4KP9Fx7k", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114737032388026855"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114718501688815616"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:59:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114718579795148915"], "id": "2114718579795148915", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 180, "impression_count": 22022, "like_count": 167, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 15}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109544824135467312", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈，最近视频都是让 Grok Bot 做的 \n\n就开了一个视频生成 Bot ， 让它去学习 opus 5.5 的视频生成 Skill \n\n做了几个视频效果还都可以，重要是这不会封号啊啊啊啊啊 https://t.co/1GdkYF3G7G https://t.co/d8taTJHOeT", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114718579795148915"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114560432862318592"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:08:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114705605189419133"], "id": "2114705605189419133", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 71, "impression_count": 9727, "like_count": 69, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 9}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114602108012073295", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈,  我第一次看这个视频的时候,  还以为是真人 \n\n后来才知道这是数字人 ,  就这个质感去起来没点问题 \n\n秘籍都在文章里了 \n\nhttps://t.co/4qHXJQn0Pb https://t.co/7GpOsrClrd", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114705605189419133"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T12:29:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114695790287630815"], "id": "2114695790287630815", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1294, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "做账号以后，情绪稳定多了。\n\n没流量的时候，已经能平静地怀疑人生。", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114695790287630815"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T12:19:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114693372103553189"], "id": "2114693372103553189", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 57, "impression_count": 5585, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114648961399349608", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "管 Grok Bot 最容易踩的坑，是不管大小事都先找一个总管主 Bot 传话，平白多烧几轮 token。\n\n其实主从和扁平根本不冲突：主从讲谁指挥谁，扁平讲中间隔几层。按活本身怎么分，常用就四种：\n1. 直线岗：存 Obsidian 笔记、跑视频工作流、发日报这种单一固定活，直接找对应岗位 Bot，别经过总管转述。 https://t.co/Sha3xyRiMR", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114693372103553189"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T10:45:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114669617771876587"], "id": "2114669617771876587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 985, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114592455001817120", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "恭喜小晚老师 5000 粉了 🎉🎉🎉,   小晚老师擅长做内容营销 和 IP塑造 \n\n有需要的 X 友可以关注下 https://t.co/KvNudsfPKv", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114669617771876587"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114656524987727872"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-26T10:16:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114662319846207518"], "id": "2114662319846207518", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 70, "impression_count": 18231, "like_count": 102, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "卧槽 ! ! !  我就服 L 总的创意,   总知道 X 友们喜欢看什么  https://t.co/vOGHzHzPGm", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114662319846207518"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-26T09:44:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114654279558692897"], "id": "2114654279558692897", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 892, "like_